{
  "label": "day89",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day89:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore0",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore0.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore0"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Milk...eggs...water...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what does she need me to buy water for? Can’t she just use the tap?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m on my way home from[school] and-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Actually, let me correct that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I was on my way home from[school]...but then Ami decided to text me a list of things I apparently need to pick up on the way home.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They’re all relatively simple ingredients, so it’s not like it’s a hassle or anything, but...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, let's just say that I wanted to use my night for something other than just running errands.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She won't mind if I'm a little late, right?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe I can hang around here for a little while before heading back?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not often that I’m in this part of town, so...I doubt there's any harm in me checking out a few extra shops or something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Worse comes to worst, I can always just tell Ami I got lost.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I cross the street and immediately find a small cafe I've never seen before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Without putting any thought into it, I push open the doors and wander inside- hoping to find a beautiful girl that is at least slightly open to the idea of having sex with me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore1.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I wind up finding Haruka.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Cool.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, hey. What are you doing here?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Haruka?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore2.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, hey! Sorry, I just...wasn't expecting to see you out of nowhere.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm just dropping by to grab some dinner for tonight, but...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I actually left my wallet at home...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...now I am about to postpone dinner and...go get that.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Haru-chan, you don’t need to go home, dear. You’re here every day.",
      "spk": "Old Lady",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let this one be on us. The least we can do to pay you back is give you a free meal every once in a while...",
      "spk": "Old Lady",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "An old woman, presumably the store owner, calls out to Haruka from behind the counter.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore3.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? No! I couldn’t do something like that to you!",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You remember I run a cafe as well, right? I know what it's like to miss out on a sale because of forgetful people like this.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...give me like half an hour and I'll be right back. I promise.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You live around here, Haruka?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore4.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right around the corner, actually.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I used to stop by this place every day with my-",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore5.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My friend.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My...uhh...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My friend and I would come here all the time and...meet up for dinner and stuff.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore2.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...enough about me! Do you live around here as well?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve only seen you at the cafe and...the bistro that one time- so I have no idea if you’re local or not.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't really live around here, no. Just...passing by while running some errands.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's no big deal, though. I'll probably just wind up taking the bus home anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore6.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t have a car?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that surprising?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore7.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? No, I...I didn’t mean anything bad by it, I swear. I mean, it's not like you even really need one in Kumon-mi.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can always give you a ride home if you want, though.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore2.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only thing is we’d need to head back over to my place first since I didn't drive here.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Plus, I'd also like to come back and pick up dinner once I can actually, like...you know. Pay for it.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure? I wouldn’t want to burden you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore4.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dude, it’s totally fine. I don’t mind at all. In fact, I welcome the company. I just cleaned my living room and no one's been around to be impressed by how nice it looks.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you not have people over very often?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore8.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one other than the same two people who have been coming around for years now.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Apart from them, it's probably been...three or four years since anyone else came over?",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am incredibly lonely. Please comfort me by blessing me with your presence.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore9.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Platonically, of course. I promise I’m not hitting on you.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore10.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore10r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore10r.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore10r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait? What? No. Don't be awkward, Haruka. Just be yourself.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...don’t really know how to interpret this exchange, but if you’re that determined to have me over, I’ve got no problems at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t stay that long, though. My [niece] is expecting me with groceries.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore6.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, you live with your [niece]? I had no idea.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course you had no idea. We’ve only had like two real conversations since we’ve met.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, but that’s your fault. It’s not like you don’t have my number.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And pretty soon, I’ll have your address as well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore10r2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore10r2.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore10r2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry. That sounded a lot creepier than I wanted it to.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know, man. I might be having second thoughts about this now that I know there's a chance for you to stalk me.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore10r3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore10r3.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore10r3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But at the same time...it's not like being stalked would be that bad, would it?...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore2.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, uhh...either way, we should probably get a move on if I don't want my dinner to be ice cold by the time I pick it up.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. I felt weird just standing around without ordering anything anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Great. It’s not far, I promise. We'll be there in like...fifteen minutes tops.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Haruka and I walk through her neighborhood together, chatting about various cafe-related things to help kill time along the way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For someone who is apparently extremely lonely, she’s surprisingly good at holding a conversation.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don't know if I'm only thinking this due to association, but she's kind of like a...more mature version of Rin in a way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sure all the time she's spent in customer service helps with being able to talk to people, but it’s still surprising getting wrapped up in a conversation this...easy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who knows? Maybe she and I just have the type of personalities that bounce well off of one another.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And maybe the natural progression of these first stages of friendship will start feeling a little less natural once she starts letting her guard down.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore11.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welp, here we are!",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Congratulations on being the first man here in God knows how long.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks for having me. Also, wow- what a clean living room.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks for humoring me. I don't get those sorts of casual compliments from Sara.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Any time she's here, she just goes straight for the wine and it's...off to the races.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, Sara is an alcoholic and I am not. Comparing the two of us doesn't really work all that well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore12.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ehh...I don't really know if I'd say that.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sara might have a drinking problem, but you guys are actually pretty similar in a bunch of ways.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What sort of ways are you referring to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's...",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know. It's kind of hard to talk about without making it sound like I'm both judging you and dishing out details about her that she probably wants to be kept secret for now.",
      "spk": "Haruka",
      "spkColor": "#FF48DC",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that's not ominous at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene harukastore12r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/harukastore12r.webp",
      "alt": "harukastore12r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S-Since we're on the topic of her, though...there's...",
